<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.04 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.04 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 6.04 percent in the week ended May 10 from 5.98 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   May 10, 1997  May 3, 1997   May 11, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.04	  +5.98	    +4.43</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  322.8	  322.3	    304.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended May 11, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
